signup - register a new account (online sign-up)

usage: signup

    Available only when logged in at the guest gate (guest).
    Asks for a handle and password, and registers you as a probationary
    member. You cannot choose your login ID; it is issued automatically
    in order, like prd00001 (prd + a 5-digit sequence, lowercase, fixed
    8 chars). The name shown on screen is the handle (free text, up to
    8 full-width / 16 half-width chars).
    After registering, note the issued ID, then disconnect and reconnect.
    While probationary you can only read. Once sysop approves you, you can
    post.
